---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import '../../styles/game.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Chroma Dash · galaxyrio"
  description="一场小小的调色游戏。拖动红、绿、蓝滑杆，调出你眼中的颜色。"
  bodyClass="game-page"
  themeColor="#fff2dc"
>
  <header class="game-topbar">
    <img
      class="game-brand"
      src="/images/chroma-dash-logo.webp"
      alt="CHROMA DASH"
      width="1070"
      height="195"
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="high"
      draggable="false"
    />
    <a class="back-link" href="/" aria-label="返回游戏库"
      ><Icon name="back" size={22} /><span>返回</span></a
    >
    <div class="console-tools">
      <button
        class="icon-button"
        data-open-dialog="game-help"
        aria-label="玩法说明"
        title="怎么玩"><span class="help-mark">?</span></button
      >
      <button
        class="icon-button"
        data-sound-toggle
        aria-label="音效"
        title="开关音效"><Icon name="sound" size={20} /></button
      >
      <button
        class="icon-button"
        data-open-dialog="settings-dialog"
        aria-label="设置"
        title="设置"><Icon name="settings" size={20} /></button
      >
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="background-doodles" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="doodle doodle-star" viewBox="0 0 90 90"
      ><path d="M45 7 53 33 81 38 58 53 58 80 39 62 14 71 25 46 9 26 36 29Z"
      ></path><path d="m32 43 3 4m17-5 2 4m-18 9q9 8 17-2" class="doodle-face"
      ></path></svg
    >
    <svg class="doodle doodle-flower" viewBox="0 0 100 100"
      ><path
        d="M49 34C18-6 3 36 30 48 0 65 28 93 45 66 46 99 86 84 68 59 103 62 93 22 65 34 77 4 40 0 49 34Z"
      ></path><circle cx="49" cy="49" r="11"></circle></svg
    >
    <svg class="doodle doodle-squiggle" viewBox="0 0 100 65"
      ><path d="M5 42Q16 10 29 32T53 27 79 22 96 8"></path></svg
    >
    <svg class="doodle doodle-spark" viewBox="0 0 70 70"
      ><path d="M34 5q1 26 28 29-28 2-29 29Q30 36 7 34 31 30 34 5Z"></path></svg
    >
  </div>
  <div class="game-shell">
    <main id="main" class="toy-console">
      <i class="console-screw screw-top" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <i class="console-screw screw-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      <h1 class="sr-only">Chroma Dash</h1>
      <div class="mode-score-line">
        <div class="mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="选择游戏模式">
          <button data-mode="accuracy" aria-pressed="true">准度挑战</button>
          <button data-mode="speed" aria-pressed="false">速度挑战</button>
          <button data-mode="blind" aria-pressed="false">盲猜模式</button>
        </div>
        <div class="total-stat">
          <Icon name="sparkle" size={18} /><span id="score-label">平均准度</span
          ><strong id="total-score">—</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="play-surface" aria-label="Chroma Dash 调色台">
        <div class="color-workspace">
          <div class="comparison-heading">
            <div class="clock-unit" id="clock-unit">
              <Icon name="clock" size={16} /><span id="timer">30.0s</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="timer-track" id="timer-track" hidden>
            <div id="timer-progress"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="swatch-pair">
            <figure class="color-sample">
              <figcaption>目标颜色<span aria-hidden="true">✦</span></figcaption>
              <div class="swatch is-covered" id="target-swatch">
                <span class="swatch-cover" id="target-cover"
                  ><span class="sleepy-face" aria-hidden="true"
                    ><i></i><i></i><b></b></span
                  ><span>猜猜是什么颜色？</span></span
                >
              </div>
            </figure>
            <figure class="color-sample">
              <figcaption>你的颜色<span aria-hidden="true">♡</span></figcaption>
              <div class="swatch is-covered" id="guess-swatch">
                <span class="swatch-cover" id="guess-cover"
                  ><span class="sleepy-face curious-face" aria-hidden="true"
                    ><i></i><i></i><b></b></span
                  ><span id="guess-cover-label">等你来调色</span></span
                >
              </div>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </div>
        <form class="mixer" id="mixer-form" novalidate>
          <div class="mixer-heading">
            <h2>调一调</h2><button
              id="reset-color"
              class="icon-button"
              type="button"
              aria-label="重置为中性灰"
              title="重置颜色"
              disabled><Icon name="restart" size={18} /></button
            >
          </div>
          <fieldset id="mixer-controls" disabled>
            <legend class="sr-only">RGB 与 HEX 调色</legend>
            {
              (['R', 'G', 'B'] as const).map((channel, index) => (
                <div
                  class:list={[
                    'channel-control',
                    'channel-' + channel.toLowerCase(),
                  ]}
                >
                  <label
                    class="channel-label"
                    for={'range-' + channel.toLowerCase()}
                  >
                    <>
                      <b>{channel}</b>
                      <span class="sr-only">
                        {['红色', '绿色', '蓝色'][index]}
                      </span>
                    </>
                  </label>
                  <input
                    id={'range-' + channel.toLowerCase()}
                    type="range"
                    min="0"
                    max="255"
                    step="1"
                    value="128"
                    aria-label={channel + ' 通道滑杆'}
                  />
                  <input
                    id={'number-' + channel.toLowerCase()}
                    aria-label={channel + ' 通道数值'}
                    type="number"
                    min="0"
                    max="255"
                    step="1"
                    value="128"
                    inputmode="numeric"
                  />
                </div>
              ))
            }
            <div class="submission-meta">
              <div class="hex-control">
                <label for="hex-input">色号 <span>HEX</span></label><input
                  id="hex-input"
                  type="text"
                  value="#808080"
                  maxlength="7"
                  spellcheck="false"
                  autocomplete="off"
                  autocapitalize="characters"
                  aria-describedby="input-error"
                />
              </div>
              <div class="submission-feedback" title="上次提交的准确率">
                <span class="accuracy-readout"
                  >准确率 <strong id="attempt-accuracy">—</strong></span
                >
                <span class="penalty-slot" aria-hidden="true"
                  ><span id="penalty-float" class="penalty-float"></span></span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </fieldset>
          <p id="input-error" class="input-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
          <button class="submit-color" type="submit" id="submit-color"
            ><span id="submit-label">开始调色！</span><span id="submit-icon"
              ><Icon name="arrow" size={23} /></span
            ></button
          >
          <p
            id="attempt-notice"
            class="sr-only"
            role="status"
            aria-live="polite"
            aria-atomic="true"
          >
          </p>
          <p class="submit-hint">
            <kbd>Enter</kbd><span id="submit-hint">开始本局</span>
          </p>
        </form>
      </section>
      <footer class="console-footer">
        <button
          class="restart-run"
          id="restart-run"
          aria-label="重新开始本局"
          title="重新开始"
          ><Icon name="restart" size={17} /><span>重来</span></button
        >
        <section class="round-history" aria-label="本局成绩">
          <div id="round-chips" class="round-chips">
            {
              Array.from({ length: 10 }, (_, i) => (
                <span
                  class="round-chip"
                  aria-label={'第 ' + (i + 1) + ' 题未完成'}
                >
                  {String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
          <span id="average-label" class="sr-only">平均 —</span>
        </section>
        <button
          class="icon-button fullscreen-control"
          data-fullscreen
          aria-label="全屏"
          title="全屏游玩"><Icon name="expand" size={20} /></button
        >
      </footer>
      <p id="mode-description" class="sr-only">
        每关 30 秒，共 10 关；到时自动提交，最终成绩为平均准确率。
      </p>
    </main>
  </div>
  <dialog id="game-help" class="system-dialog" aria-labelledby="help-title">
    <div class="dialog-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">一点小提示</p><h2 id="help-title">
          把眼前的颜色调出来
        </h2>
      </div><button
        class="icon-button"
        data-close-dialog
        aria-label="关闭玩法说明"><Icon name="close" /></button
      >
    </div><div class="instruction-list">
      <p>
        <b>01</b><span
          >调整 R、G、B 滑杆，或输入 RGB、HEX 色值。提交后按颜色相似程度计算
          0–100% 的准确率。</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>02</b><span
          >准度挑战：每关 30 秒，共 10
          关。到时自动提交当前有效颜色，查看答案时暂停，下一关重新计时；最终成绩为
          10 关的平均准确率。</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>03</b><span id="speed-help"
          >速度挑战：共 10 关，每关不限时。准确率大于 90% 立即过关；90%
          及以下加罚 1 秒，留在当前关。最终总用时包含罚时，越低越好。</span
        >
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>04</b><span
          >盲猜模式：沿用准度挑战的每关 30 秒、共 10
          关和平均准确率规则。调色时看不到你的颜色；提交或到时后揭晓，点击下一关继续。</span
        >
      </p>
    </div><p class="dialog-note">
      Tab 切换控件，方向键微调滑杆，Enter
      提交。挑战进行中打开帮助、设置或切换标签页不会暂停计时。
    </p>
  </dialog>
  <dialog
    id="summary-dialog"
    class="system-dialog summary-dialog"
    aria-labelledby="summary-title"
  >
    <button
      class="icon-button summary-close"
      data-close-dialog
      aria-label="关闭结算，查看最后一题"><Icon name="close" /></button
    ><div class="summary-emblem"><Icon name="trophy" size={35} /></div><p
      class="eyebrow"
      id="summary-mode"
    >
      准度挑战 · 本局结束
    </p><h2 id="summary-title">又收集了一盒彩色！</h2><div
      class="summary-total"
    >
      <strong id="summary-total">0%</strong><span id="summary-score-label"
        >平均准确率 · 越高越好</span
      >
    </div><div class="summary-stats">
      <div>
        <strong id="summary-average">0</strong><span>平均准确率</span>
      </div><div>
        <strong id="summary-best">0</strong><span>最高准确率</span>
      </div><div>
        <strong id="summary-rounds">0 / 10</strong><span>完成关卡</span>
      </div>
    </div><p id="summary-time-detail" class="summary-time-detail" hidden></p><p
      id="summary-note"
    >
      已保存到本机游玩记录。
    </p><button class="play-button" id="play-again"
      >再来一局 <Icon name="restart" size={18} /></button
    ><a class="summary-back" href="/">返回游戏库</a>
  </dialog>
  <dialog
    id="restart-dialog"
    class="system-dialog"
    aria-labelledby="restart-title"
  >
    <div class="dialog-heading">
      <h2 id="restart-title">重新开始这一局？</h2><button
        class="icon-button"
        data-close-dialog
        aria-label="继续当前游戏"><Icon name="close" /></button
      >
    </div><p class="dialog-description">
      当前这一局的进度将清空。之前完成的游玩记录会保留。
    </p><div class="restart-actions">
      <button class="subtle-button" data-close-dialog>继续当前游戏</button
      ><button class="play-button compact" id="confirm-restart">重新开始</button
      >
    </div>
  </dialog>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/game';
  </script>
</Layout>
